  "abstract": "Presents an Energy-Flow Cosmology (EFC) mechanism in which an entropy-driven modification of the effective gravitational coupling unifies the galaxy-scale Radial Acceleration Relation (RAR) with the cosmological Hubble tension. The paper derives a consistent coupling a_G \u2248 0.1 from both MOND/RAR phenomenology and the H0 discrepancy via a Friedmann-based constraint a_{H0} = 1/2 a_G, predicting H0 \u2248 73.9 km/s/Mpc from galactic dynamics alone within 1.2% of observations.",
